@callara_ I like to brainstorm about this, but I'm definitely not any kind of expert!

One thing I think is very cool is Paul Boswell's work https://t.co/nE86rjmV0v and https://t.co/d5d7F2oOyU .

Vi Hart's videos are also just remarkable eg. https://t.co/fPdQEQjmM2 .

@pararths @paraschopra I think the best hints we have are:

(1) More complex types of induction heads (eg. translation, pattern matching https://t.co/vLs8kUiBDS )

(2) Neurons we understand in SoLU models (https://t.co/IEbnYAMsd9 )

